Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The simulation has one third-party runtime dependency, which is installed
from PyPI and NOT bundled or redistributed by this project:

  - numpy .................. BSD-3-Clause ........ https://github.com/numpy/numpy

The optional dashboard (rest_sim/dashboard_index.html) loads the following
library from a public CDN at view time. It is NOT bundled or redistributed
by this project:

  - Chart.js 4.4.1 ......... MIT License ......... https://github.com/chartjs/Chart.js

The restaurant, menu, staff and table data in data/ are fictional and
were created for this benchmark.

